    {
      "id": "D2BMM6bv0McLUYW1fB08j",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1936.2309945878308,
      "y": 1167.5559589837526,
      "width": 955.8072509765625,
      "height": 540,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "av",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1740027105,
      "version": 793,
      "versionNonce": 426989615,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "-iyyAdtWexUs7wurRAAui",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1777674877930,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Del planteamiento anterior, sabemos que para unsigned, en este caso, la multiplicación es:\n\n\n(x_u * y_u) = (x_u * y_u) mod 2^w\n\nY para two's complement:\n\n(x_t * y_t) = U2T( (x_t * y_t) mod 2^w ) \n\n\nPodemos relacionar signed y unsigned bajo la siguiente propiedad:\n\nx_u = x_s_{w-1} * 2^w + x_s\n\n\nDe esta manera, podemos establecer una equivalencia donde:\n\n\n(x_u * y_u) mod 2^w = (x_s * y_s) mod 2^w\n\n( [x_s_{w-1}*2^w + x_s] * [y_s_{w-1} * 2^w + y_s]) mod 2^w = (x_s * y_s) mod 2^w\n\n( x_s * y_s + 2^w(x_s_{w-1}*y_s + y_s_{w-1}*x_s) + 2^2w * x_s_{w-1} * y_s_{w-1} ) mod 2^w  = (x_s * y_s) mod 2^w\n\n\n\n(x_s * y_s) mod 2^w = (x_s * y_s) mod 2^w",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Del planteamiento anterior, sabemos que para unsigned, en este caso, la multiplicación es:\n\n\n(x_u * y_u) = (x_u * y_u) mod 2^w\n\nY para two's complement:\n\n(x_t * y_t) = U2T( (x_t * y_t) mod 2^w ) \n\n\nPodemos relacionar signed y unsigned bajo la siguiente propiedad:\n\nx_u = x_s_{w-1} * 2^w + x_s\n\n\nDe esta manera, podemos establecer una equivalencia donde:\n\n\n(x_u * y_u) mod 2^w = (x_s * y_s) mod 2^w\n\n( [x_s_{w-1}*2^w + x_s] * [y_s_{w-1} * 2^w + y_s]) mod 2^w = (x_s * y_s) mod 2^w\n\n( x_s * y_s + 2^w(x_s_{w-1}*y_s + y_s_{w-1}*x_s) + 2^2w * x_s_{w-1} * y_s_{w-1} ) mod 2^w  = (x_s * y_s) mod 2^w\n\n\n\n(x_s * y_s) mod 2^w = (x_s * y_s) mod 2^w",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
